        },
        {
          "commit": "8c23ec0d4840246bbc47324a1673fa7aa714c056",
          "note": "live watchdog read could abort a run on a split UTF-8 character (better-borg-c#220); fixed by 56ccf741. The observer is unchanged between the two pins.",
          "until": "2026-11-08"
        }
      ],
      "note": "The better-borg-c runner and observer at this commit build and run every specimen. A specimen is the game and Borg source at its own ref; the observer instrumentation comes from the harness commit. It applies to specimens of kind \"better-borg-c\" (the default). Specimens of kind \"borg-rs\" are built and run by borg-rs's own harness at the specimen's ref (harness/build.sh and the borgh frontend). This pin is also a specimen ref (4.2.6-bbc-9ca98661): the harness bumped with the mode-cutoff restart so runner and specimens move together (borg-zoo#54).",
